			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- end banner -->

		<!-- start section -->
		<section class="about-us-section" id="about-us">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row mb-8 align-items-center">
				
					<div class="col-xl-12 col-lg-12 text-center" data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 600, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'>
						<h2 class="text-dark-gray fw-600 ls-minus-3px alt-font highlight-separator-small">Nagu Saabsan</h2>
						<p class="w-100">Wasaaradda Waxbarashada iyo Sayniska (MoES), iyada oo ay u sii marayso Unugga Hirgelinta Mashruuca (PIU), waxay hadda kormeeraysaa hirgelinta Mashruuca “Somaliland Empowering Women through Education and Skills” – Rajo Kaaba (Lambarka Mashruuca: P176898). Mashruucan waxaa loo sameeyay in lagu taageero haweenka Soomaaliyeed, gaar ahaan da’da u dhaxaysa 15 ilaa 35 sano, iyada oo loo marayo kor u qaadidda fursadaha waxbarasho tayo leh iyo tababbar xirfadeed.</p>


					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- end section -->


		<section class="bg-light background-position-center-top overlap-height number-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center mb-2 sm-mb-50px position-relative">

					<div class="col-lg-5 offset-lg-1 last-paragraph-no-margin" data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "opacity": [0, 1], "rotateY": [-90, 0], "rotateZ": [-10, 0], "translateY": [80, 0], "translateZ": [50, 0], "staggervalue": 200, "duration": 900, "delay": 300, "easing": "easeOutCirc" }'>
						<span class="text-base-color fw-600 mb-15px text-uppercase d-block">Ujeeddooyinka</span>
						<h2 class="fw-600 text-dark-gray w-90 lg-w-100 text-dark-gray fw-700 ls-minus-2px">Ujeeddooyinka Mashruuca Rajo Kaaba:</h2>

					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="row">

					<div class="col-xxl-4 col-lg-4" data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 300, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'>
						<div class="mb-60px sm-mb-30px last-paragraph-no-margin">
							<span class="d-inline-block fs-15 text-uppercase fw-700 text-black mb-5px">In la xoojiyo haweenka iyo gabdhaha dhallinyarada ah iyada oo loo marayo waxbarashada aasaasiga ah iyo horumarinta xirfadaha:</span>
							<p>Mashruucu wuxuu u oggolaanayaa gabdhaha iyo haweenka dhallinyarada ah in ay helaan waxbarasho aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan akhris-qoris iyo xisaab, xirfado nololeed iyo bulsho, iyo tababbar xirfadeed heer gelitaan ah. Ujeeddadu waa in la dhiirrigeliyo ka-qaybgalka dhaqaale iyo in la hagaajiyo fursadaha nolosha ee muddada dheer, gaar ahaan kuwa si taariikhi ah uga maqnaa waxbarashada rasmiga ah iyo suuqyada shaqada.</p>
						</div>

					</div>
					<div class="col-xxl-3 col-lg-3 " data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 300, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'>
						<div class="mb-60px sm-mb-30px last-paragraph-no-margin">
							<span class="d-inline-block fs-15 text-uppercase fw-700 text-black mb-5px">In la ballaariyo fursadaha loo heli karo Barashada Xirfadaha Farsamada iyo Teknolojiyadda (TVET):</span>
							<p>Mashruucu wuxuu kor u qaadayaa helitaanka barnaamijyada TVET, isagoo si gaar ah diiradda u saaraya dhallinyarada, gaar ahaan haweenka, iyada oo la bixinayo xirfado la jaanqaadaya baahida suuqyada shaqada, lana xoojinayo awoodda hay’adaha waxbarashada si ay u daboolaan baahiyaha shaqo ee dalka.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-xxl-2 col-lg-2 " data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 300, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'>
						<div class="mb-60px sm-mb-30px last-paragraph-no-margin">
							<span class="d-inline-block fs-15 text-uppercase fw-700 text-black mb-5px">In la xoojiyo tayada tababarka macallimiinta heerka dugsiga hoose:</span>
							<p>Mashruucu wuxuu kor u qaadayaa heerarka waxbaridda si loo hagaajiyo natiijooyinka waxbarasho ee ardayda dalka oo dhan.
</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-xxl-3 col-lg-3 " data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 300, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'>
						<div class="mb-60px sm-mb-30px last-paragraph-no-margin">
							<span class="d-inline-block fs-15 text-uppercase fw-700 text-black mb-5px">In la horumariyo adeegyada caafimaadka hooyada iyo dhallaanka:</span>
							<p>Mashruucu wuxuu xoojinayaa nidaamka caafimaadka iyada oo la horumarinayo awoodda hay’adaha waxbarashada kalkaalinta iyo umulisooyinka. Tani waxay gacan ka geysan doontaa kor u qaadidda tayada adeegyada caafimaadka iyo natiijooyinka caafimaad ee gobollada aan si wanaagsan loo adeegsan.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- end section -->

